# Design System Rules

## Source of Truth
- Enforce `docs/design/design-system-contract.md`.
- Treat archived design files as reference artifacts, not runtime code.

## Token Usage
- Use token variables for spacing, radius, color, typography, and state.
- Do not hardcode ad hoc values in components unless first added to tokens.

## Canonical Decisions
- Accent family: green (`#1DB954`, `#1ED760`).
- Radius scale: `8, 12, 16, 22, 30, pill`.
- Spacing grid: 4px base and approved steps only.
- Numeric UI must use mono/tabular numerals.

## UI Behavior
- Dark theme is primary baseline.
- Accent use must indicate action/state importance, not decoration.
- Support keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior in all new interactive UI.
